  "why": "A mission `until robot_charge r < 30 %` (0048 S6) with the bound the request states: `at most 6 runs`. The until is not a bound by itself (0041 M2). Dropping the until, inventing a duration, or another threshold or robot is a different request. A round may be one task (6 runs) or two run lines `out` and `back` (12 runs): both are accepted. 2.3 has no `robot_charge` (`E204`).",
